<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dain Bosworth raises Caterpillar.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dain Bosworth raises Caterpillar.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Dain Bosworth Inc said Wednesday it upgraded Caterpillar Inc to buy from hold, based on recent results.</p>
<p>--Analyst J. Blair Brumley also raised his fourth quarter estimate to $2.02 a share from $1.81 and raised his 1997 estimate to $8 from $7.25.</p>
<p>--Price target for the heavy equipment maker is $96, Brumley said in a research report.  The stock closed Tuesday at 76-1/4.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
